  "description": "Chatterbox Turbo (ResembleAI/chatterbox-turbo-ONNX) text-to-speech with voice cloning for DemaConsulting.Speech, run directly through ONNX Runtime on the CPU with no bundled native inference engine. This package owns the full pipeline for this one model family itself - byte-level BPE tokenization (embedded), reference-voice conditioning, autoregressive speech-token generation and waveform decoding - installed into a SpeechModelCatalog via the AddChatterboxTurboModels() extension method. Voices are cloned from reference clips (WAV or FLAC): the caller can supply them, drop them into the per-user reference-voices folder, or install the model-agnostic CC0 voice-zero reference-voice pack that DemaConsulting.Speech downloads on request; no audio is bundled in the package.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
